msgid "Remove old action payloads while keeping IDs, outcomes and recovery evidence. Completed results must be at least 30 days old. Automation results also require every consuming run to have finished or been explicitly abandoned at least 30 days ago. Unfinished runs, untracked usage, uncertain or failed writes, and receipts with an unknown completion date are kept."
